---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {withBase} from '../lib/base';import {stories} from '../lib/registry';
---
<Base title="The first issue"><div class="wrap"><header class="page-head"><h1>A little less dependent.</h1><p>Issue 001 · November 2026. Six stories about useful things you can make, understand, and keep. Start with a question. Leave with a working tool.</p></header><section class="archive-section" aria-label="Issue contents"><label class="search-label" for="story-search">Find a story in this issue</label><input class="story-search" id="story-search" type="search" placeholder="Try “browser”, “week”, or “AI”"/><p id="search-status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>{stories.map(s=><article class="archive-row" data-story={(s.title+' '+s.description+' '+s.kind).toLowerCase()}><span class="story-type">{s.kind}</span><div><h2><a class="story-title" href={withBase('/'+s.slug+'/')}>{s.title}</a></h2><p>{s.description}</p></div><span class="time">{s.time} read</span></article>)}<p id="no-stories" class="empty-search" hidden>No matching stories. Try a different word or clear the search.</p></section><section class="editor-note"><h2>Make something.</h2><p>The issue includes a <a href={withBase('/tools/link-library/')}>Link Library</a>, a <a href={withBase('/tools/decision-workbench/')}>Decision Workbench</a>, and a <a href={withBase('/tools/one-page-week/')}>One-page Week</a>. Future issues appear here and in the <a href={withBase('/feed.xml')}>RSS feed</a>. No next issue is scheduled yet.</p></section></div>
<script>
const input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#story-search');const rows=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-story]')];const status=document.querySelector('#search-status');const none=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#no-stories');
if(input){input.value=new URL(location.href).searchParams.get('q')||'';function filter(){const q=input!.value.trim().toLowerCase();let count=0;rows.forEach(row=>{row.hidden=!q.split(/\s+/).every(term=>row.dataset.story!.includes(term));if(!row.hidden)count++;});if(status)status.textContent=q?`${count} ${count===1?'story':'stories'} found`:'';if(none)none.hidden=count!==0;const url=new URL(location.href);if(q)url.searchParams.set('q',input!.value);else url.searchParams.delete('q');history.replaceState(null,'',url);}input.addEventListener('input',filter);filter();}
</script>
</Base>
